    "id": "cardoai/cardoai-client-plugins/abf-asset-class-context",
    "name": "abf-asset-class-context",
    "description": "Use when an ABF transaction's asset class is known and you need its KPI catalog, entity model, applicability profile, or enum vocabulary. Triggers when list_transactions reveals a transaction's asset_class, when an analyst names an asset class (auto loans, credit cards, CRE hospitality, trade finance, cell tower, etc.), or asks \"what KPIs / stratifications / dimensions apply to X\". The knowledge is served by the ABF MCP server as resources; this skill is the protocol for resolving the asset_class string against the server's index and loading only the sections the question needs.\n",
